From 2d37df48c12e1d749931798fdc5fdc169d3f8f13 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: YeonGyu-Kim <code.yeon.gyu@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 4 May 2026 19:06:21 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 4863/5749] refactor(team-mode): use dedicated focus and grid
 windows for team layout
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Replace in-window pane splitting with two purpose-built windows
(focus: main-vertical, grid: tiled) created off the target session,
so leader pane is never disturbed and layouts no longer collapse
under teammate count.

🤖 Generated with assistance of [OhMyOpenCode](https://github.com/code-yeongyu/oh-my-opencode)
